{"1446530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Girauden Strike Force", "steam_appid": 1446530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Girauden Strike Force is an elite team of specially trained space pilots who do the jobs no one else will do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, that means mostly babysitting and collecting rocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three playable characters to shoot your way through 5 missions. Each ship has its own unique power, speed, and defense. There's one catch – your team's earnings pay for the expensive shield systems, and the finance department runs a tight shop. Run out of money, and you're left wide open! Fight pirates, destroy asteroids, figure out who left the coffee pot empty, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created in Unity 2018.3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UPDATE 9/25/2025: New version available! All new art assets, gameplay rebalancing, and new missions have been added including new tutorial levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Known bugs: Under specific conditions, pause menu buttons cannot be interacted with. Pause menu can still be closed with Esc. Occurs in Mission: Shameless PR Stunt, Waves 2-5. Currently investigating.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Girauden Strike Force is an elite team of specially trained space pilots who do the jobs no one else will do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, that means mostly babysitting and collecting rocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three playable characters to shoot your way through 5 missions. Each ship has its own unique power, speed, and defense. There's one catch – your team's earnings pay for the expensive shi